# Claude
.claude/

# Ruleset JSONs — these describe required-status-check / bypass-actor /
# protected-branch internals and must never land in a public repo. The
# actual files live in the maintainer's private store and are applied via
# `gh api --input <private-path>`. Belt-and-braces in case a future PR
# tries to re-introduce them.
.github/rulesets/